# Tone, Rain, Clip — title design

One static title, no other scenery, characters or props. Center the exact text “Tone, Rain, Clip” in white (#FFFFFF) DejaVu Sans Book, 80 px, on deep navy (#101B2B). The text ink bounds are centered horizontally and vertically. RGB canvas: 1280×720. No fades, overlays or animation.

Reference and editorial source: title.png in this directory. The editor holds this card throughout 240 frames at 24 fps, from 00:00 through 00:10. The title is intentionally independent of the four sound phases.

Regeneration: python3 picture/make_title.py, using Pillow and the system DejaVu Sans font.

